s in."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright then, I'll be waiting to hear from you, hardhead.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Persica hangs up, and the Commander leans back against their chair with a long and heavy sigh."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR18","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,120"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AR-18","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, your directions, please."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Patch me into Muromets. The operation has officially begun."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"17xh-Networld","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_22W_BGM_3","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Inside the Muromets Conference Room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, we've established the connection and the Muromets signal is stable."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, then I'll start the briefing.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The objective of this operation is two-fold—rescue Ange before executing Operation Kriemhild... and capture the target known as \"William\".","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Two objective markers appear in mid-air in the conference room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You are currently in the Muromets Conference Room. We will use this communications system to tackle the electromagnetic disruption in Avernus.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All operational reports will be made through here.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":18,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good evening, everyone! It's me, Mercury! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm here to make sure that this connection remains safe, stable, and smooth. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With a little help from Miss Persica, hm, that is to say, the anti-Paradeus jamming device, everything will be just fine!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Taraxacum will be responsible for ensuring signal stability and clarity once you enter Avernus."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aliana will be our field commander once we enter the combat zone. I'll be monitoring and giving directions remotely.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Squad Puzzle and Squad Palette will provide ground-based fire direction. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Fe56 will split into two teams; Team D will be airdropped onto the roof of the Western Tower when the mission begins, where they will proceed to work downward and eliminate the tower's artillery emplacements. Team C will land on the tower platform and draw their fire. Exploiting the weather condition and the blind spots of the Western Tower, Daybreak will circle around stealthily to launch an assault on the Eastern Tower and search for the mission objective. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Taraxacum will stay put and wait for Daybreak's signal. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After we find the objective, we'll retreat ASAP and ensure a successful segue into Operation Kriemhild."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Any questions?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Muromets Conference Room briefly quiets down."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR18","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,120","commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AR-18","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, the Elmo has entered the Black Zone. We're 27 km from our objective, Avernus.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Got it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks around at everyone in the room and calmly declares..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We will now commence Operation Ilya Muromets.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_2022Saros_button","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander presses the activation button in the Muromets Conference Room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Thunder_Dry","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Rumble) The first thunderclap roars through the sky outside the Elmo."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The storm has come."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_BlackArea_1","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"effect","value":"%%code=CJ_rain%%","raw":"common_effect"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Rain_Heavy","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The whistling of the wind accompanies the pouring of the rain and drowns out all other sounds."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_engine_speedup","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The jeep moves swiftly and silently, like a killer whale diving into the depths of the ocean. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Compared to the clamor outside, the air inside the vehicle is eerily quiet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"SCR tightens her grip on her gun. She is trembling all over."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCR","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"SCR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you get nervous, Leader?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{